  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Arithmetic and geometric progressions, and the binomial expansion of \\( (a+b)^{n} \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Series",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "AP sum \\( S_n=\\tfrac{n}{2}\\big(2a+(n-1)d\\big) \\); GP sum \\( S_n=\\tfrac{a(1-r^{n})}{1-r} \\); binomial \\( (1+x)^{n}=1+nx+\\tfrac{n(n-1)}{2}x^{2}+\\cdots \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "AP term",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a+(n-1)d \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "AP sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac{n}{2}(2a+(n-1)d) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "GP sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac{a(1-r^{n})}{1-r} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Binomial",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( {}^nC_r \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 10.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the sum of the first \\( 10 \\) terms of \\( 2,5,8,\\dots \\)</p>\\[ S_{10}=\\frac{10}{2}\\big(4+27\\big)=155. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example — Geometric series &amp; sum to infinity",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>A geometric series has first term 12 and common ratio \\(\\tfrac{2}{3}\\). Find (a) the 5th term, (b) \\(S_\\infty\\).</p><p>(a) \\(u_5=12\\cdot(\\tfrac{2}{3})^4=12\\cdot\\tfrac{16}{81}=\\tfrac{64}{27}\\).</p><p>(b) \\(S_\\infty=\\dfrac{12}{1-\\tfrac{2}{3}}=\\dfrac{12}{\\tfrac{1}{3}}=36\\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "Find the coefficient of \\(x^3\\) in the expansion of \\((2+x)^7\\).",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "\\(\\binom{7}{3}(2)^4(x)^3=35\\times16\\times x^3=560x^3\\). Coefficient is \\(560\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
